  "body": "Current specification does not provide a way to remove am existing \"simulated Bluetooth adapter\" via BiDi commands. [`bluetooth.simulateAdapter`](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#bluetooth-simulateAdapter-command) specifies how it is created, but not removed. The CDP has a method `BluetoothEmulation.disable`, and it would be useful to have something similar in BiDi. Otherwise the restart of the whole browser required to restore the status quo.",
